From 68622bc8fb9e2c4fd042542a35009ef4fb5a95ae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: oneshot <oneshot@localhost>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 14:59:47 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] android: translucent controls; the keyboard only after a tap
 on a field

The joystick, D-pad and right-hand buttons draw at 60% outside the editor.
A text field that took the focus by itself no longer raises the soft keyboard:
only a press on a field (EditBox/TextField click, the book page) does. The
in-game chat still raises it when it opens. winit's IME stays off on Android,
the sink is not focusable once hidden, and launcher fields and dialogs wait
for a tap too.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
